          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p>
    Once you can navigate that short list, build one of these four project ideas end to end. Each one is
    designed to produce the single artifact most Indian product interviews are actually testing for: a real
    decision, honestly documented.
  </p>
